# Source downloads and derived intermediates — all regenerable.
# The curation that matters (overrides.json) is NOT ignored.
#
# All three lines are load-bearing, in this order:
#
#   !data/   the REPO ROOT .gitignore excludes `data/` as a directory, and git
#            does not descend into an excluded directory — so without this, no
#            negation below can reach anything inside, and the one irreplaceable
#            file in the project stays silently untracked. (It was.)
#   data/*   re-exclude the CONTENTS, as children rather than as a directory,
#            which is what leaves the next line reachable.
#   !...     the exception that actually matters.
#
# Verify after any edit — the failure mode here is silence, not an error:
#   git check-ignore -v citybrowser/data/overrides.json   # must print nothing
!data/
data/*
!data/overrides.json
cache/
